# Memory
- ILC e2e regression verification workflow (reproducible):
  1. dotnet build tests\cases\<n>\<n>.csproj -c Release -o tests\cases\<n>\out
  2. run <n>.exe -> expected.txt (exit!=0 => SKIP)
  3. rm gen + build_mingw; il2cppc.dll <n>.exe gen (never rebuild transpiler)
  4. cmake -S gen -B build_mingw -G "MinGW Makefiles"
  5. cmake --build build_mingw --parallel 16
  6. run build_mingw\il2cpp_gen_exe.exe -> actual.txt
  7. Compare-Object expected vs actual; both must be non-empty; PASS iff empty diff
